    "source": "The widest launch-deck footprint in the game: the largest horizontal distance from a mission spawn to any corner of any `spawn.startGrid` box. Those boxes are Unity built-in cubes inside 2016's own PlayerStart_ElevatorShaft_Photon_02.prefab (see src/render/start-grid.ts), and the six scenes that materialise the deck agree to 13 cm.",
