    "scatterIsNotReproducible": "2016's scatter used an UNSEEDED UnityEngine.Random inside an editor-only GenerateObjects(), so the shipped layout cannot be regenerated. It was verified to be pure generator output (grid test, docs/private/PROP-AUDIT.md §4): desert is 9,600 on-grid against 53 hand-placed landmarks, and alpine is on-grid once the Tree Pack prefab offsets are accounted for. Nothing was hand-tuned, so re-rolling with a SEEDED prng loses no authored intent.",
